  "solution": "def generate_powerset(nums: list[int]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    import itertools\n    res = []\n    for r in range(len(nums) + 1):\n        for combo in itertools.combinations(sorted(nums), r):\n            res.append(list(combo))\n    return res\n",
  "explanation": "Generates all combinations of length r from 0 to N in O(2^N) time."
